OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for 'pause' on Local Plan
OL,4,Aover green belt
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said Sheffield's latest Local
OL,7,FPlan must be paused again to consider
OL,8,F"new evidence" about prime agricultural
OL,9,Fland in the green belt.
OL,11,FMarie Tidball (Penistone and
OL,12,FStocksbridge) said the city needed more
OL,13,Fhomes but planning framework should
OL,14,Futilise existing brownfield sites as
OL,15,Fwell as high streets and retail spaces.
OL,17,FShe said the plan must not be skewed
OL,18,Ftowards green belt land in the S35 and
OL,19,FS13 postcodes, locations which had been
OL,20,Fassessed as likely to contain the "best
OL,21,Fagricultural land".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
